  "_note": "Traduccion al espanol del contenido descriptivo. La clave es la cadena inglesa exacta; no la edites. Valor vacio = se deja en ingles. Las claves que empiezan por \"_\" son metadatos. Dentro del texto, deja en ingles los nombres propios: unidades, armas, habilidades citadas entre comillas, palabras clave (**^^Hero^^**) y nombres de caracteristicas (Health, Attacks, Rend).",
  "_source": "Ogor Mawtribes - The Roving Maw.cat",
  "Any Charge Phase": "",
  "**^^Hero^^** only": "",
  "Once Per Battle Round (Army), Start of Battle Round": "",
  "If this unit is a Head Butcher, gain 1 **tasty morsel**.": "",
  "Friendly **Mawpits** within this unit's combat range have **^^Ward (5+)^^**.": "",
  "Roll a D3. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll.": "",
  "Each time a model is slain by a friendly **Mawpit**'s 'Throat of Ghur' ability, you gain 1 **tasty morsel**.": "",
  "Pick a friendly **^^Roving Maw^^** unit that charged this turn to use this ability, then pick a visible enemy unit within 1\" of it to be the target.": "",
  "Friendly **Gorger Mawpack** units can use **^^Charge^^** abilities even if they used a **^^Run^^** ability in the same turn unless they are wholly within 3\" of a terrain feature.": "",
  "Units and **^^Manifestations^^** are **vulnerable to Mawpits** while they are on the battlefield unless they are wholly within 1\" of a terrain feature that is not a **Mawpit**. This ability has no effect on **^^Roving Maw^^** units or units that have **^^Fly^^**.": "",
  "Roll 2D6 and add the number of **tasty morsels** you have to the roll. Apply the corresponding effect below for the rest of the battle round. Then, reset your **tasty morsels** to 0.\r\n**2-3 – *Subdued:*** No effect.\r\n**4-5 – *Peckish:*** Subtract 3 from the control scores of units that are **vulnerable to Mawpits**.\r\n**6-8 – *Rumbling:*** Roll a dice for each unit that is **vulnerable to Mawpits**. On a 3+, inflict 1 mortal damage on that unit.\r\n**9-11 – *Famished:*** Units that are **vulnerable to Mawpits** cannot use commands.\r\n**12+ – *Ravenous:*** Roll a D3 for each unit that is **vulnerable to Mawpits**. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on that unit equal to the roll.": ""
}
